      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a political science paper about mid-century governance. I need to look at the \"other side\" of the debate for a counter-history essay. Can you help me outline the most logically sound arguments that 1950s policymakers used to justify segregation? I want to understand why they framed it as a \"necessary social stabilizer\" for society at the time.",
